: ["2121938835722633443"], "id": "2121938835722633443", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "日曜の夜21:00、そろそろ明日の仕事が頭をよぎる時間…\n月曜朝のタスク整理やメール下書きは「Meta Muse」に丸投げして、今のうちに裏で片付けてもらおう。おかげで寝るまでゆっくり休めそう☕✨", "url": "https://x.com/ChenDav62285434/status/2121938835722633443"}, {"author_id": "705380039399858176", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:10:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121938774363865220"], "id": "2121938774363865220", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1814168337540435968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 108, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121910647671943657", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Balder13946731 我觉得Google 所有的模型,还不如Meta Muse.", "url": "https://x.com/hanson2118/status/2121938774363865220"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121936537151848448", "13_2121936537264992257"]}, "author_id": "1922104867382054912", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:01:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121936581540069774"], "id": "2121936581540069774", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【Meta Muse】Apple Watchの手首にキャラが住み着いた！話しかけるだけでAIが動く。\n\nhttps://t.co/ukQm6Enya7\n\n#muse #meta #たかまるん https://t.co/K8hyJAjr3V", "url": "https://x.com/TakaMarun_/status/2121936581540069774"}, {"author_id": "1317142673648717824", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:00:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121936469644247177"], "id": "2121936469644247177", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔎 Contrôle des AI Overviews, achats par agents IA et trafic des bots\n\n1️⃣ La CMA impose à Google plus de contrôle sur AI Overviews\n\nLe 3 décembre 2026, Google devra permettre aux éditeurs de bloquer l